  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;an odd function.</p><p>By using the property of definite integration, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mi>a</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>d</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1.4ex 1.4ex\"><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>a</mi></msubsup></mtd><mtd><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>, we can write<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo stretchy=\"true\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></munderover><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo></mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>",
